  No application fee.\nDuration: 3 to 5 days of job shadowing at one organi
 sation\, with mobility actions taking place between 1 October 2026 and 30 
 June 2027.\n\nMore: https://www.kunsten.be/en/calls/kooperativa-x-fai-mobi
